OL,3,GNEWSA'In a country that loves country
OL,4,Amusic, there was nobody like her' -
OL,5,AIrish musicians mourn Dolly parting
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton's death has been felt
OL,8,Facross the world since it was announced
OL,9,Fon Tuesday evening, from her native
OL,10,FTennesse to the village of Ventry in
OL,11,FCounty Kerry, where in 1990 she stopped
OL,12,Fin for a song and a drink in a rural
OL,13,Fpub.
OL,15,FA booming country music scene across
OL,16,Fthe island of Ireland has kept the
OL,17,FQueen of Country as relevant today as
OL,18,Fever, and many local talents have paid
OL,19,Ftribute to their late idol.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
