OL,3,GNEWSA'In a country that loves country
OL,4,Amusic, there was nobody like her' -
OL,5,AIrish musicians mourn Dolly parting
OL,6,
OL,7,FIrish country music artist Claudia
OL,8,FBuckley said she was "heartbroken" to
OL,9,Fhear of Parton's death, describing the
OL,10,FUS singer-songwriter as her biggest
OL,11,Finspiration.
OL,13,FLondonderry-born singer Mairead Carlin
OL,14,Fpaid her respects too, and said Parton
OL,15,Fwas someone who was "beautiful inside
OL,16,Fand out".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
